{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_05_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_05","title":"物资回收计划","storyCode":"OD-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"01be6e69f8fa62fe0b18db68f8046b5ec7c41bc7cc015131568664d13e659032","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"罗德岛干员与彩虹小队干员达成了合作协议，双方决定保守行动，尽量在城镇骚乱之外不卷入政治风波，驻守安全屋。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"加油！Lord！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！！呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"差一点！还差一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"拉上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"好样的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......能徒手拉开这张弩，确实是一把好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这弩的设计也太夸张了，表面上根本看不出来有这么高的拉力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这种重弩是很常见的类型，大部分萨卡兹人都能徒手拉开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这种力道的重弩......100米以内威力不会比枪械小，就是用起来太费事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......有关体能差异这件事，我之前已经领教过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"闹不好那个放电的姑娘力气都不比我小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说雷蛇吗？她毕竟是瓦伊凡，瓦伊凡确实是体格强壮的种族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么突然对这些武器感兴趣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"既然可预见的高频度战斗在前，现在确实得思考一下弹药用完后该怎么办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没有子弹，枪械都是烧火棍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候总不能和他们肉搏吧，光从刚才的经历来看，我觉得就没什么胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"还剩下多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我这边不多了，不到400发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"给你看个东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么......子弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这是那位叫雷蛇的罗德岛干员使用的子弹，学名叫“蚀刻子弹”，据说是非常昂贵的产品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经拆开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这子弹是什么结构啊，发射药呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这块结晶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"看着像是能量源，它是算发射药还是战斗部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫从前听拉特兰工匠讲过，每一发蚀刻子弹内都装着一块微型施术单元，这些施术单元都与拉特兰铳的结构相互对应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，不仅是铳器本身，就连它们发射的每一发蚀刻子弹都等同于术师的法杖，所以蚀刻子弹才会造价高昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"与之对应的源石技艺也复杂深奥，只有萨科塔人才会大量使用铳器，其他人则会选择更易于使用的远程武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰是国名，萨科塔是种族名，拉特兰人并不都是萨科塔......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"但关于子弹的部分可真是个坏消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这个世界上就没有什么普通枪械吗？不需要“源石技艺”的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......不需要源石技艺的铳械，老夫可从来没听说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"走一步看一步吧，至少那些爆炸物大家都能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹他们在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在地下室，还在尝试修复长得像无线电台的通讯器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯施术单元还是无法供能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是能源的问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能......我得试试看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你们躲开一点，优等生要开始表演了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......充能准备......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喔！喔！喔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是源石技艺？这效果也太酷炫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......让人印象深刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启动了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得漂亮，不愧是我的移动能源小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你除了烦我，就没有别的事情做了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，还是无法接通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是晶体电子单元损坏太严重了，也可能是其他地方的电路有肉眼不易察觉的损坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里也没有维修源石电路的专业设备，没法系统性地排查问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，看起来是没戏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这种源石技艺什么的，普通人能学会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理论上说......绝大多数人经过培训之后都可以学会一定程度的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是源石技艺的学习需要付出心血与时间，而且也与天赋密切相关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人即便是付出了远超他人的艰辛，最后也只能掌握一些最基础的法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫就是比较愚钝的人，自始至终都没能学会什么源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是一些对现状的畅想......有点疯癫，还缺乏实践意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，库兹先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来试试看吧，这面盾牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这是怎么......盾牌上面装了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根据你盾牌的原本结构和功能，安装了高功率射灯和通用源石回路，应该能发挥出你惯用装备的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......可是我也不会“源石技艺”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"严格地说，通用源石回路，就是让不会使用源石技艺的人也能使用源石设备的现代科技成果。这些设备里可以储存一些简单的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，装置供能和设备维护还是需要专业术师来做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，让我看看，还真有点沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"......开关......激发装置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，我试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！居然真的有效！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我还得适应一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"整整半年没有顶盾冲锋，我都快忘记怎么用这东西了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的动向如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"上一轮攻击也是最后一次敌对行动，至今都没有再发生试探性进攻。我不觉得这是个好现象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其考虑到他们是一群组织有序的混蛋，这感觉就更不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"暴风雨前的平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"医生休息了，他已经好几天没睡觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"让那个孩子歇歇吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他这个年龄，不该承担这么多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"目前还有一个问题。我们的食物快要不够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，之前奥克芬先生跟我说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么想法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，要不要回去一趟病人社区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你们有办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"我们离开那边的时候非常匆忙，不少病人的家里应该还有没带走的粮食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。现在我们人手充足，可以去回收物资了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"那么事不宜迟，赶在天黑之前应该来得及。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
